WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.356
Stage 5 is phone, voicemail and missed-call text-back.

00:00:04.356 --> 00:00:08.043
Trendi sets up a dedicated business number for your country.

00:00:08.043 --> 00:00:15.041
Your own mobile number stays the same: you simply tell your phone to pass calls on to the Concierge number.

00:00:15.041 --> 00:00:22.810
Choose whether Concierge answers only the calls you miss, or every call, then copy the forwarding code for your phone.

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:27.900
Never forward calls to your own mobile, or you will send them round in a circle.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:38.600
Callers hear a clear AI notice, voicemails go straight into your CRM, and optional missed-call text-back sends one follow-up text with your booking link.
